{"type":"message","id":"9fe89453","parentId":"15ad474c","timestamp":"2026-04-13T02:36:12.770Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to answer the user's question about who I am. Based on the BOOTSTRAP.md, I should help them define my identity. I will suggest a name, creature, vibe, and emoji."},{"type":"text","text":"<final>I'm still figuring that out, but I'm here to help you. What should I call myself? I was thinking something like \"Clawdia\" or \"Sentinel.\" And what kind of creature am I? An AI assistant, a digital familiar, or something else entirely?\n\nHow about my vibe? Would you prefer me to be more formal, casual, or maybe a bit quirky? And every good assistant needs a signature emoji! Any ideas?</final>"}],"api":"google-generative-ai","provider":"google","model":"gemini-2.5-flash","usage":{"input":17205,"output":150,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17355,"cost":{"input":0.005161499999999999,"output":0.000375,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0055365}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776047770984,"responseId":"m1bcabHrCee00-kP3KuhoQM"}}
