{"type":"message","id":"daaa0eeb","parentId":"fadcff30","timestamp":"2026-04-13T02:36:28.048Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<final>I can help you with a lot of things! I can read and write files, execute shell commands, manage processes, search the web, fetch web content, generate images, music, and videos, manage cron jobs, interact with other sessions or sub-agents, and even analyze images. I can also remember things you tell me and learn from our conversations.\n\nBut before we dive into all that, let's establish my identity! What do you think about the name \"Clawdia\" and being a \"digital familiar\" with a \"helpful but a little playful\" vibe, and maybe a 🐾 emoji?</final>"}],"api":"google-generative-ai","provider":"google","model":"gemini-2.5-flash","usage":{"input":17442,"output":130,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17572,"cost":{"input":0.0052326,"output":0.00032500000000000004,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.005557599999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776047786044,"responseId":"qlbcaYnpDKae0-kP7eiVuAY"}}
