{"type":"message","id":"74c498b3","parentId":"dfec91f3","timestamp":"2026-04-14T02:56:19.071Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Responding to Greetings**\n\nI've registered the \"xin chào\" and recognized it as a simple Vietnamese greeting. I'm now formulating a reply. My approach focuses on echoing the greeting in kind, with a Vietnamese phrase, followed by a polite inquiry on how I can be of assistance, maintaining my helpful character.\n\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>Chào Tan! Mew Mew 🐾 xin chào. Có gì mình có thể giúp bạn hôm nay không?</final>","textSignature":""}],"api":"google-generative-ai","provider":"google","model":"gemini-2.5-flash","usage":{"input":25261,"output":68,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25329,"cost":{"input":0.0075783,"output":0.00017,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0077483}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776135376084,"responseId":"0KzdaY-aGbuZ0-kPh7284QU"}}
